WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.835
-The Trump administration

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.002
has decided to just move on

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.570
from the coronavirus pandemic

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.571
and pretend it's over,

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:06.572
even though, in reality,

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.374
it's still here,
and getting worse.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.577
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:14.314
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.182
The nation has obviously
been focused

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.584
on the weeks of sustained
mass demonstrations

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:21.320
against systemic racism
and police brutality,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.923
but, at the same time,
the pandemic is still here.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.924
It hasn't gone anywhere.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.325
The coronavirus is like

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:28.294
my copy of "The Thorn Birds."

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.130
It hasn't been on my side
table for a few weeks,

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.931
but that doesn't mean
it was gone forever.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.233
It was just off-camera
and now it's back.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.369
But I can promise you
what's not back

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:39.338
is labored bits where I add
books or change the titles.

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:41.207
And, look, there was
never a good time

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.209
to have the world's
dumbest man as president,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.212
but the timing could not
be worse right now,

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.314
as the country faces some
of its weightiest

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.416
and most difficult challenges
in our lifetimes.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:51.650
There are mass demonstrations

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.154
against systemic racism
and police brutality.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:57.223
Unemployment is at its highest
since the Great Depression.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.592
North Korea
just blew something up.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.594
Tensions are escalating
between India and China.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.496
The coronavirus pandemic
is still raging

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.131
and The New York Times reports

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:09.201
that toilets can spray plumes
of coronavirus into the air

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:10.803
and infect the next person
who uses them.

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:13.706
Now, we can't even
enjoy toilet plumes.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.809
The only thing I had left
to look forward to this summer

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.377
was loading the kids
into the van

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:19.912
and taking them
on a cross-country trip

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.582
to see America's most
picturesque toilet plumes.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.050
2020 sucks!

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.918
And may I say,
this is the first dent

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:27.954
in the otherwise
sterling reputation

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.422
of Porta Potties.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.090
Also, that's gotta be
the most embarrassing way

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.260
to catch coronavirus.
Were you near any large crowds?

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.563
"No, but I --
I maybe huffed a plume."

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:38.864
So, things are bad.

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:41.000
In a situation like this,
the very minimum

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.770
we should expect from our leader
is his ability to provide us

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.405
with a shared sense of reality,
to give us all the facts,

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.273
but the president,
he doesn't wanna do that.

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:51.210
In fact, he's repeatedly
expressed an interest this week

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.046
in hiding the truth
about the coronavirus pandemic,

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:57.049
suggesting that,
if we just stopped testing,

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.451
it would go away.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.220
-Today, President Trump
attributed an increase in cases

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.222 line:0%
in some states
to advanced testing.

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:06.659 line:0%
In a tweet, he said, "Without
testing, or weak testing,

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.594 line:0%
we would be showing
almost no cases.

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.363 line:0%
Testing is
a double edged sword -

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.233 line:0%
Makes us look bad,
but good to have!!!"

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:16.068
-Our testing is so far advanced,

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:18.370
it's so much bigger and better
than any other country,

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:19.572
that we're gonna have
more cases.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.006
We're always going
to have more cases

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:24.377
and, as I said this morning,
that's probably the downside

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:27.413
of having good testing,
is you find a lot of cases

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:30.482
that other countries, who don't
even test, don't have.

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:32.184
If you don't test,
you don't have any cases.

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:34.353
If we stop testing right now,

00:02:34.353 --> 00:02:36.189
we'd have very few cases,
if any.

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.923
-I can't believe I have
to explain this.

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:39.125
If we stopped testing,

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.693
that wouldn't mean
the cases went away.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.561
That would just mean
we don't know about them.

00:02:42.561 --> 00:02:44.163
When you play peekaboo
with a baby,

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.331
the baby can't see you,

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.800
but that doesn't mean you
actually disappear.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.002
Do you remember when people
were making those viral videos,

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:53.339
when they stand behind a cover
in front of their dog,

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:55.574
then drop the blanket
and run away

00:02:55.574 --> 00:02:57.643
and the dogs thinks
they disappeared?

00:02:57.643 --> 00:02:58.777
That's Trump.

00:02:58.777 --> 00:03:00.313
[ As Trump ] What the hell?
He was just

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:01.647
standing behind the blanket.

00:03:01.647 --> 00:03:03.416
Damn you to hell,

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:04.616
ghost blanket!

00:03:04.616 --> 00:03:05.618
"You called for me, sir."

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:06.619
Not you, ghost blanket.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.220
The other ghost blanket.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.090
Now, this is a sentiment Trump
has repeated several times --

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.792
if only we could stop testing,

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.861
we'd look so much better,
which is just insane.

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.862
It's like if you went
to your optometrist

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:19.332
and they said, "I could
give you an eye exam,

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:21.567
but then, you'd need
glasses to drive."

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.869
That doesn't mean
you don't need glasses,

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:26.138
just means you'll probably get
in more car accidents

00:03:26.138 --> 00:03:28.107
than Billy Joel.
And that's

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:30.843 line:0%
another Billy Joel
car crash joke!

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:33.612 line:0%
And, yes, that is a reference
that is 16 years old,

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:35.615
which means, if that
reference were a person,

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:37.717
they would have no idea
who Billy Joel is.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.385
And, if you're
a person who is surprised

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:42.622
that I'm still making Billy Joel
car crash jokes in 2020,

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.622
all I can say is

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:46.125
♪ You oughta know by now ♪

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:48.561
♪ We are having fun
in our attic ♪

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.830
Now, Trump is,
in his own unique way,

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.231
breathtakingly dumb,

00:03:52.231 --> 00:03:53.833
but the rest
of his administration

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:57.135
is just as committed to this
coronavirus coverup as he is,

00:03:57.135 --> 00:03:59.005
even if they manage to be
a little more subtle about it.

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.940
Vice President Mike Pence,
for example,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.975
urged governors,
on a call this week,

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:06.646
to lie about the increasing
number of coronavirus cases.

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:08.046 line:0%
-According
to The New York Times,

00:04:08.046 --> 00:04:09.515 line:0%
at a conference call,

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:13.086 line:0%
the VP urged governors to...

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:26.966
-The idea that cases
are going up

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.068
because testing has increased
is a lie.

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:30.769
And, sure, Mike Pence might

00:04:30.769 --> 00:04:32.805
look more convincing
than Trump when he lies.

00:04:32.805 --> 00:04:35.741
He shakes his head
and furrows his brow

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:37.777
like a community theater actor,

00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:40.679
looking even more the part
of a statesman,

00:04:40.679 --> 00:04:43.182
thanks to sharing a two-shot
with a man who looks like

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:45.318
he's trying to get you
to play the ring toss

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:47.419
down on the
Coney Island boardwalk.

00:04:47.419 --> 00:04:48.854
But it's still a lie.

00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:50.756
The increase in testing
is not the reason

00:04:50.756 --> 00:04:51.924
for the increase in positives.

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:52.992
In fact...

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:03.235 line:0%
Just look at this map from the
website covidexitstrategy.org,

00:05:03.235 --> 00:05:05.538 line:0%
with states that are
trending poorly in red.

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.240
Just because Trump has gotten
bored with something

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.607
doesn't mean it's gone away.

00:05:08.607 --> 00:05:09.976
You think he would've at least

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.443
learned that lesson
from these two.

00:05:11.443 --> 00:05:12.811
[ As Trump ]
What are you two losers
doing here?

00:05:12.811 --> 00:05:13.813
I thought you disappeared.

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:15.414
"No, Dad.
We went to summer camp."

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:16.849
I thought it was permanent
summer camp.

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:18.083
The Trump administration

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:20.252
has even been contradicted
by their own scientists.

00:05:20.252 --> 00:05:24.057
On Tuesday, Dr. Anthony Fauci
said the increase in cases...

00:05:26.425 --> 00:05:28.327
Which is just obviously true.

00:05:28.327 --> 00:05:29.996
What do you think is more
likely to be responsible

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.964
for an increase of cases
of infectious disease,

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:35.100
increased testing
or reopening gyms; malls;

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.336
barbershops; bowling alleys;
massage parlors;

00:05:37.336 --> 00:05:40.239
and everyone's favorite
local tavern, O'Coughagin's?

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:42.140
And, yet, the Trump
administration is committed

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.443
to the lie that the coronavirus
has just disappeared

00:05:44.443 --> 00:05:46.011
when, in reality,
it never went away

00:05:46.011 --> 00:05:48.180
and it is, in fact,
getting worse.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:49.782
Yesterday,
Pence published an op-ed

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:51.384
in The Wall Street Journal
titled...

00:05:54.119 --> 00:05:57.256
Yeah, that's because we're
not done with the first wave.

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:59.358
That's like serving someone
an undercooked hamburger

00:05:59.358 --> 00:06:00.560
and, while they're still
eating it, saying,

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.560
"See?

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:02.561
There's no diarrhea."

00:06:02.561 --> 00:06:03.829
There will be.

00:06:03.829 --> 00:06:05.531
There just isn't any yet.

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.665
In fact we've failed miserably,

00:06:06.665 --> 00:06:08.700
compared to most other
developed nations.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.702
Look at this chart,
comparing our curve

00:06:10.702 --> 00:06:13.372 line:0%
of confirmed cases
to the European Union.

00:06:13.372 --> 00:06:15.074
Or look at these curves,
from The New York Times

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:17.410
for three European countries
that saw major outbreaks

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.478 line:0%
and have since suppressed
those outbreaks

00:06:19.478 --> 00:06:21.947 line:0%
and bent their curves
all the way back down.

00:06:21.947 --> 00:06:23.882 line:0%
Now, add in the United States.

00:06:23.882 --> 00:06:26.251
The U.S. is a plateau
and Italy, Spain, and Germany

00:06:26.251 --> 00:06:27.586
all have downward slopes,

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:29.155
proving something
I've long said --

00:06:29.155 --> 00:06:31.157
[ Posh accent ]
The skiing is better in Europe.

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:32.357
It just is.

00:06:32.357 --> 00:06:33.526
We should learn from them.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:35.461
Instead, our leaders
continue to politicize

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:37.963
even basic measures
that we know could stem

00:06:37.963 --> 00:06:40.233
the spread of the virus,
like mask wearing.

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:42.134
Trump and Pence
have turned mask wearing

00:06:42.134 --> 00:06:44.703
into a dumb conservative
culture war issue

00:06:44.703 --> 00:06:47.340
by repeatedly refusing
to wear one in public.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.008
And Pence did it again
during a trip

00:06:49.008 --> 00:06:51.243
to a restaurant
in Iowa on Tuesday.

00:06:51.243 --> 00:06:53.745
Dude, just be polite
and wear the mask.

00:06:53.745 --> 00:06:55.414
Why do you have to be
such a dick about everything?

00:06:55.414 --> 00:06:57.616
You think you're gonna
look stupid with a mask?

00:06:57.616 --> 00:06:59.585
The world can still go on,

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:02.421
even if we can't see
your dumb little hyphen mouth.

00:07:02.421 --> 00:07:04.523
If you put a blank piece
of paper over your face,

00:07:04.523 --> 00:07:06.024
no one would know
the difference.

00:07:06.024 --> 00:07:08.528
You already have
resting mask face.

00:07:08.528 --> 00:07:11.363
In fact, Trump seems intent
on making the situation worse

00:07:11.363 --> 00:07:14.333
by holding a giant indoor
rally on Saturday in Tulsa,

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.601
a hot spot where cases
are spiking

00:07:16.601 --> 00:07:18.471
and where the director
of the Tulsa Health Department

00:07:18.471 --> 00:07:21.540
has said he wishes Trump
would postpone the rally.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.676
Trump nonetheless
doubled down on Twitter.

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:26.279
-The president reacted
to that notion on Twitter

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:28.448
and he rejects it, saying...

00:07:39.491 --> 00:07:41.126
-You don't have to tell us
you're immune to shame.

00:07:41.126 --> 00:07:43.128
We're familiar with your work.

00:07:43.128 --> 00:07:45.697
It is clear to all of us
that you have tested positive

00:07:45.697 --> 00:07:47.365
for shame antibodies.

00:07:47.365 --> 00:07:49.768
Also don't compare a giant
indoor rally to a protest.

00:07:49.768 --> 00:07:51.803
There's a huge difference
between an outdoor gathering

00:07:51.803 --> 00:07:52.905
where everyone's wearing a mask

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:55.240
and an indoor campaign rally/
mosh pit

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.342
in an arena
with limited ventilation,

00:07:57.342 --> 00:07:59.946
where everyone's cheek-to-cheek,
chanting "Build that wall."

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:02.114
Also, no one is less
of an essential worker

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:03.549
than a Trump rally attendee.

00:08:03.549 --> 00:08:06.218
You've been chanting "Build
that wall" for five years.

00:08:06.218 --> 00:08:09.621
Nada. So, Trump is both
malevolent and dumb.

00:08:09.621 --> 00:08:11.590
Hollywood has done us
a real disservice,

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.560
trying to convince us that
evil people are all geniuses.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.461
They're always suave
and well-spoken.

00:08:16.461 --> 00:08:18.063
A lot of them have PhDs --

00:08:18.063 --> 00:08:19.565
Dr. No, Dr. Doom,

00:08:19.565 --> 00:08:20.700
Dr. Octopus.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.067
All Trump has is
a master's degree

00:08:22.067 --> 00:08:23.802
in copying off the kid
in front of him.

00:08:23.802 --> 00:08:26.806
Not only does he not know
how coronavirus testing works,

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:29.241
he doesn't even know
how his own industry,

00:08:29.241 --> 00:08:30.509
real estate, works.

00:08:30.509 --> 00:08:32.411
Here he is at a roundtable
event last week,

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:34.413
describing how -- I guess? --

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:38.517
some buildings are nicer
and also cheaper than others.

00:08:38.517 --> 00:08:41.187
-Sometimes you'll see
a building that cost less money

00:08:41.187 --> 00:08:42.621
than another building
that cost more

00:08:42.621 --> 00:08:45.857
because the one that built
the one that cost more,

00:08:45.857 --> 00:08:47.260
this one looks better.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.328
The one that's cheaper,
it looks better.

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:51.463
They say, "How much more did you
spend for that building?"

00:08:51.463 --> 00:08:52.932
Actually, we spent less.

00:08:52.932 --> 00:08:54.166
You can do that.

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:56.302
It's called you have to know
what you're doing.

00:08:56.302 --> 00:08:57.969
-He sounds like
a New York City tour guide

00:08:57.969 --> 00:08:59.037
who forgot his notecards.

00:08:59.037 --> 00:09:00.473
[ As Trump ]
Uh, interesting fact.

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:04.043
Sometimes, uh, you'll see
a building that, uh,

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:06.445
you know, cost less money
than another building

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:08.247
because, you know,
the one that built

00:09:08.247 --> 00:09:11.083
the one that cost more,
this one's cheaper and, uh --

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:12.584
Whah! M&amp;M's store.

00:09:12.584 --> 00:09:14.620
He's like a dumber version
of the kid from Jerry Maguire.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.122
"Did you know that
sometimes buildings

00:09:16.122 --> 00:09:17.489
that cost less look nicer?"

00:09:17.489 --> 00:09:20.059
Of course, the core
of what he was saying was,

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:23.629
if you make a cheap thing
look nice, people will pay more

00:09:23.629 --> 00:09:25.164
and, by the time
they realize it's cheap,

00:09:25.164 --> 00:09:27.600
you have their money and it's
too late to do anything.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.734
Trump-style!

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.803
The only -- the only --
smart move

00:09:30.803 --> 00:09:32.371
Trump ever made as a builder

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:35.908
was giving Trump Tower
an escalator, instead of a ramp.

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:38.810
The course of history
would've been very different

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.646
if that had been a ramp.

00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:42.714
[ Hushed ]
We are waiting on Donald Trump,

00:09:42.714 --> 00:09:45.551
who is expected to announce
his bid for the presidency.

00:09:45.551 --> 00:09:46.785
And here he is now,

00:09:46.785 --> 00:09:48.921
at the top of the famous
Trump Tower ramp,

00:09:48.921 --> 00:09:50.956
heading down -- fairly gingerly.

00:09:50.956 --> 00:09:52.791
And, oh, looks like
he's picking up some speed

00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:55.527
and, based on his expression,
that was not part of the plan.

00:09:55.527 --> 00:09:57.363
Oh! You can really see
the whiteness of his knuckles

00:09:57.363 --> 00:09:59.231
as they grasp helplessly
at the railing.

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:00.466
Oh, he's down!

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:01.967
He's down and he has taken
Melania with him

00:10:01.967 --> 00:10:04.636
and I do not speak Slovenian,
but those have --

00:10:04.636 --> 00:10:06.005
those just have
to be curse words.

00:10:06.005 --> 00:10:07.639
If you are just now
joining us, Donald Trump,

00:10:07.639 --> 00:10:09.608
expected to announce
a presidential run,

00:10:09.608 --> 00:10:12.044
has eaten it hard on the ramp.

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:15.047
Trump's brain is only capable
of thinking in transactions.

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:16.715
His only interest,
in any situation,

00:10:16.715 --> 00:10:19.218
is what's in it for him.
That's why he wishes

00:10:19.218 --> 00:10:21.186
he could just stop testing
for coronavirus.

00:10:21.186 --> 00:10:22.621
We've seen it time
and time again.

00:10:22.621 --> 00:10:25.757
For example, Trump's ex-National
Security Advisor John Bolton,

00:10:25.757 --> 00:10:28.627
who courageously hid
behind his mustache,

00:10:28.627 --> 00:10:30.963
rather than testify
in Trump's impeachment trial,

00:10:30.963 --> 00:10:33.699
has alleged,
in a new tell-all book,

00:10:33.699 --> 00:10:35.067
that, not only did Trump seek

00:10:35.067 --> 00:10:38.036
to leverage aid to Ukraine
to help his reelection bid,

00:10:38.036 --> 00:10:40.506
but that Trump did similar
stuff all the time.

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:44.009
-Another former aide is taking
aim at President Trump.

00:10:44.009 --> 00:10:46.846 line:0%
John Bolton, who served
as national security advisor,

00:10:46.846 --> 00:10:50.349 line:0%
says, in a new book, the
president was concerned only

00:10:50.349 --> 00:10:52.752 line:0%
with getting reelected
and that misconduct

00:10:52.752 --> 00:10:55.687 line:0%
in his foreign policy
went beyond Ukraine.

00:10:55.687 --> 00:10:56.989
-The book, which is titled

00:10:56.989 --> 00:11:00.092
"The Room Where It Happened:
a White House Memoir,"

00:11:00.092 --> 00:11:02.628
was slated to come out
next week.

00:11:02.628 --> 00:11:04.597
The publisher says
the book is...

00:11:18.076 --> 00:11:21.313
-What's the opposite of bein'
so shocked, you spit out water?

00:11:21.313 --> 00:11:23.716
Donald Trump is only driven

00:11:23.716 --> 00:11:25.618
by self-interest?!

00:11:29.287 --> 00:11:30.355
[ Gulp ]

00:11:30.355 --> 00:11:31.957
And thanks for tellin' us now.

00:11:31.957 --> 00:11:35.160
I mean, that's information that
would've been way more helpful

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.329
to us six months ago,
during the impeachment trial.

00:11:37.329 --> 00:11:39.164
You're like a guy who sees
his neighbor's house on fire

00:11:39.164 --> 00:11:41.233
and, instead of callin' 911,
writes a book called...

00:11:43.368 --> 00:11:45.837
"Bob, I wrote a book
about your house bein' on fire.

00:11:45.837 --> 00:11:47.239
I would love to send it
to you, but, you know,

00:11:47.239 --> 00:11:49.041
the house burned down.
So where are you guys now?

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:50.276
A hotel?"

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:52.812
There's no one --
no one -- to root for

00:11:52.812 --> 00:11:53.879
in a Trump vs. Bolton fight.

00:11:53.879 --> 00:11:55.748
They're both
megalomaniac sociopaths

00:11:55.748 --> 00:11:56.916
lookin' out for themselves.

00:11:56.916 --> 00:11:59.251
It's a real
Alien vs. Predator situation,

00:11:59.251 --> 00:12:01.320
except all you need
to do to stop Alien Trump

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.588
is install a ramp.

00:12:02.588 --> 00:12:03.588
He's getting
closer!

00:12:03.588 --> 00:12:04.790
He's getting closer!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.358
Oh, he's slowing down.
Oh, he's slowing down.

00:12:06.358 --> 00:12:07.559
Okay, slowing way down.

00:12:07.559 --> 00:12:08.793
Alright. You know what?
I think we're good.

00:12:08.793 --> 00:12:11.229
I think we're good
to move around our spaceship

00:12:11.229 --> 00:12:14.133
as we did before this
alien infestation.

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:15.867
The president and his team
are lying

00:12:15.867 --> 00:12:17.436
about the ongoing
coronavirus pandemic

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:19.771
in an attempt to cover it up
and pretend it's over when,

00:12:19.771 --> 00:12:20.939
in reality, it's getting worse.

00:12:20.939 --> 00:12:22.574
The pandemic has laid bare

00:12:22.574 --> 00:12:24.309
the weaknesses
of our institutions

00:12:24.309 --> 00:12:26.178
and proven, once again, that,

00:12:26.178 --> 00:12:28.280
in order to be president,
at the very least...

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:29.681
-You have to know
what you're doing.

00:12:29.681 --> 00:12:31.216
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:31.216 --> 00:12:34.687
♪♪

00:12:34.687 --> 00:12:36.288 line:0%
As New York struggles to reopen,

00:12:36.288 --> 00:12:38.189 line:0%
remember that we're still
a city in crisis

00:12:38.189 --> 00:12:39.324 line:0%
and City Harvest has been

00:12:39.324 --> 00:12:40.892 line:0%
